---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Hakkımda — Ozan Özdil"
  description="Ozan Özdil: Orman Mühendisi. Linux, açık kaynak ve orta format fotoğrafçılık."
  currentPath="/hakkimda"
  maxWidthClass="max-w-4xl"
>
  <div class="space-y-10 py-2 sm:py-4">
    <!-- Profile Header Card -->
    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117]">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6">
        <div class="relative w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700 flex-shrink-0 bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 shadow-xs p-0.5">
          <img src="/avatar.jpg" alt="Ozan Özdil" class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg" />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-600 dark:text-[#00ffcc] uppercase">
            Orman Mühendisi
          </p>
          <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 font-sans">
            Ozan Özdil
          </h1>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Orman Mühendisliği, Linux, Açık Kaynak ve Fotoğraf.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 pt-1 text-xs font-mono">
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-700/80 text-[11px]">
              Kastamonu, TR
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-200/60 dark:border-emerald-800/60 text-[11px]">
              KTÜ Orman
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-700/80 text-[11px]">
              Fujifilm GFX
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Biography Section -->
    <section class="space-y-4 font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pb-2">
        Biyografi
      </h2>

      <p>
        Karadeniz Teknik Üniversitesi Orman Fakültesi mezunuyum. Orman mühendisliği formasyonunun kazandırdığı ekosistem dinamikleri ve analitik bakış açısı, teknolojiye ve yazılım dünyasına yaklaşımımın da temelini oluşturuyor.
      </p>

      <p>
        Kamu yönetimi, kurumsal iletişim ve yerel yönetim süreçlerinde görev aldım. Belediye başkan danışmanlığı ile Ar-Ge ve Bilgi İşlem yöneticiliği görevlerinde bulundum; dijital iletişim süreçleri, kriz yönetimi ve kurumsal bilişim altyapılarını koordine ettim.
      </p>

      <p>
        Açık kaynak ekosisteminde Arch Linux tabanlı kişisel masaüstü yapılandırmam (<a href="https://github.com/ozdil/omarchy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-600 dark:text-[#00ffcc] font-medium underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-80">Omarchy</a>), güvenlik ve sistem denetleme araçları geliştiriyor, yerel yapay zeka modelleri üzerine denemeler yapıyorum.
      </p>

      <p>
        Aynı zamanda Fujifilm GFX orta format kamera sistemiyle belgesel mimari ve tabiat fotoğrafçılığı yürütüyor; Kastamonu'nun tarihi dokusunu, ahşap işçiliğini ve kanyonlarını belgeliyorum.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Skills Grid -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pb-2">
        İlgi Alanları & Odaklar
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-sky-600 dark:text-[#00ffcc] font-bold">[SYS]</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">Linux & Masaüstü</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Arch Linux, Wayland, Hyprland, QuickShell arayüzleri ve Omarchy yapılandırmaları.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">[SEC]</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">Sistem Güvenliği</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            USB aygıt güvenliği, paket güvenlik açığı taramaları ve yerel ağ transfer araçları.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-bold">[AI]</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">Yerel Yapay Zekâ</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Yerel donanımda çalışan açık kaynak modeller, LM Studio ve geliştirici araçları.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold">[FOTO]</span>
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">Orta Format Fotoğraf</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
            Fujifilm GFX orta format sistemleri ile mimari miras ve tabiat belgeseli.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Experience Timeline -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pb-2">
        Deneyim
      </h2>

      <div class="relative border-l border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 ml-2 space-y-6 pl-5 pt-2">
        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[25px] top-1.5 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-[#08090b]"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">
              Açık Kaynak & Bağımsız Çalışmalar
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">2022 — Günümüz</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Omarchy Linux yapılandırması, açık kaynak betikler ve yerel araçlar.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[25px] top-1.5 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-[#08090b]"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">
              Ar-Ge & Bilgi İşlem Yöneticiliği
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">2022</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Kurumsal bilişim altyapısı, sunucu sistemleri ve dijital dönüşüm süreçleri.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[25px] top-1.5 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-[#08090b]"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">
              Belediye Başkan Danışmanlığı & Medya Yönetimi
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">2019 — 2022</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Basın-yayın, kurumsal iletişim, halkla ilişkiler ve dijital medya koordinasyonu.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[25px] top-1.5 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-[#08090b]"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">
              İletişim & Seçim Koordinasyonu
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">2019</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Yerel seçim kampanyasında saha koordinasyonu, iletişim ve görsel prodüksiyon.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative group">
          <div class="absolute -left-[25px] top-1.5 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-400 dark:bg-zinc-600 ring-4 ring-white dark:ring-[#08090b]"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline justify-between gap-1">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans">
              Karadeniz Teknik Üniversitesi
            </h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">Lisans</span>
          </div>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            Orman Fakültesi, Orman Mühendisliği Bölümü.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Connect Links -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 pb-2">
        Bağlantılar
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 gap-2.5 font-mono text-xs">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/ozdil"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117] hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-[#00ffcc] text-center transition-all group"
        >
          <span class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 block mb-1">GitHub</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-[#00ffcc] transition-colors">@ozdil</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://steamcommunity.com/id/ozanozdil"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117] hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-[#00ffcc] text-center transition-all group"
        >
          <span class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 block mb-1">Steam</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-[#00ffcc] transition-colors">ozanozdil</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="https://nsosyal.com/ozanozdil"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117] hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-[#00ffcc] text-center transition-all group"
        >
          <span class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 block mb-1">NSosyal</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-[#00ffcc] transition-colors">@ozanozdil</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/galeri"
          class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117] hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-[#00ffcc] text-center transition-all group"
        >
          <span class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 block mb-1">GFX</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-[#00ffcc] transition-colors">Galeri</span>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/rss.xml"
          class="p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#0e1117] hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-[#00ffcc] text-center transition-all group"
        >
          <span class="text-[11px] text-zinc-400 block mb-1">Akış</span>
          <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 group-hover:text-sky-600 dark:group-hover:text-[#00ffcc] transition-colors">RSS.xml</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
